                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2235] If a schedule renegotiation has not completed successfully within the ScheduleRenegotiationPayloadID sidestream, then the SECC shall decide if it wants to abort or retry the schedule renegotiation. If the SECC wants to retry the schedule renegotiation it shall restart the process according to [V2G20-1845] and set the ResponseCode of the ChargeLoopRes to WARNING_ScheduleRenegotiationFailed. If the following schedule renegotiation fails to complete again, then the SECC is allowed to escalate by setting the ResponseCode of the ChargeLoopRes to FAILED_ScheduleRenegotiation and to terminate the charging session (see 8.8.2 on general FAILED behavior).",
            "block_bbox": [
                68,
                1014,
                1054,
                1249
